# Project KB (populated by /survey, /know-me-better, /download-ref)
.knowledge/

# Advisor literature caches (per-advisor .knowledge/, populated by /know-me-better or /download-ref):
# track the queryable text (rendered papers + INDEX.md + NOTES.md) so advisors ship with their
# library, but keep the heavy / copyright-encumbered binaries (raw PDFs, JSON, extracted figures)
# out of git — those are rebuildable from references.bib via download-ref.
!advisors/*/.knowledge/
advisors/*/.knowledge/.raw/
advisors/*/.knowledge/.figures/

